{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20248","headline":"吊卢殷 二 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唧唧复唧唧，千古一月色。\n新新复新新，千古一花春。\n邙风噫孟郊，嵩秋葬卢殷。\n北邙前後客，相吊爲埃尘。\n北邙棘针草，泪根生苦辛。\n烟火不自煖，筋力早已贫。\n幽荐一盃泣，泻之清洛滨。\n添爲断肠声，愁杀长别人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}